  "content": "<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/qjonte2.png\" alt=\"Formations Overworld Banner\" width=\"1903\" height=\"797\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Formations Overworld</strong> 为各个主世界生物群系添加了许多新结构！</h3>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/yl2Gq3d.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>结构</strong></h4>\n<h5>以下是您可以在 Formations Overworld 中找到的部分结构示例。更多图片请查看图片画廊。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/697/310/172/bamboo_hut.png\" alt=\"丛林中的竹屋\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/712/310/172/tower_remnant.png\" alt=\"旧塔楼的遗迹\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/714/310/172/desert_houses.png\" alt=\"沙漠中的小房子\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/thumbnails/737/722/310/172/wagon.png\" alt=\"被雪覆盖的马车\" width=\"310\" height=\"171\"></p>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<div><img src=\"https://imgur.com/ksGhYpe.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></div>\n<div>&nbsp;</div>\n<h4><strong>常见问题</strong></h4>\n<h5><strong>我可以在我的整合包中使用您的模组吗？</strong></h5>\n<h5>是的，欢迎在您的整合包中使用我的模组。</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/TNtFe30.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h4><strong>Discord</strong></h4>\n<h5>如需了解未来内容、即将推出的模组以及参与讨论，欢迎加入 SuperMartijn642 的 Discord 服务器！</h5>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/QEbGyUYB2e\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://imgur.com/IG1us6p.png\" alt=\"Discord join button\" width=\"373\" height=\"93\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/iLGGqDH.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/tsJvc9x.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://imgur.com/M8GKFFk.png\" alt=\"Separator\" width=\"1903\" height=\"230\"></p>",
